      "created_at": "2016-03-23T22:00:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Correllary question: &nbsp;You play DDA, which plays Know When to Hold Fast, which moves you to the \"end of turn\" phase. &nbsp;Do End of Turn effects (such as Gloomy's voodoo pins) happen before or after DDA finishes resolving?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I would say they happen first, but I could easily see it going either way.</p>",
