      "created_at": "2016-03-23T22:04:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Correllary question: &nbsp;You play DDA, which plays Know When to Hold Fast, which moves you to the \"end of turn\" phase. &nbsp;Do End of Turn effects (such as Gloomy's voodoo pins) happen before or after DDA finishes resolving?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I believe that if you play Know When to Hold Fast, you skip the entire rest of your turn, including any End of Turn effects. The Scholar is too busy relaxing on the beach to be bothered by Gloomweaver's pesky pins.</p>",
