      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-03-23T23:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>How it works with an End of Turn effect on The Scholar as done in the video game.</p><ul>\n<li>Play Don't Dismiss Anything</li>\n<li>The Scholar plays the top card, Know When to Hold Fast</li>\n<li>Moves to End of Turn</li>\n<li>The rest of the players decide what they want from Don't Dismiss Anything</li>\n<li>End of Turn effects happen</li>\n<li>Move to the Start of Turn phase for the next turn</li>\n</ul>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:51:34.660Z",
